Z||000000||btoth||05-18-2001||06:31 PM||||I was reading <A HREF="http://tlc.discovery.com/news/briefs/20010507/bacteria.html" TARGET=_blank>http://tlc.discovery.com/news/briefs/20010507/bacteria.html</A>  on the TLC website and got to thinking.  I always thought it was an interesting theory that life on was seeded from somewhere in space or from other planets.  There is some other interesting reading at <A HREF="http://www.panspermia.com" TARGET=_blank>http://www.panspermia.com</A>  too.  What does everyone else think about this stuff?||||reg||1
